<title>BELGIUM: EU invites tenders for sugar as food aid to Angola.</title>
<headline>EU invites tenders for sugar as food aid to Angola.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>An invitation to supply 400 tonnes of sugar as European Union food aid to Angola has been published by the Commission in the Official Journal released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deadline for tenders for the shipment to the World Food Programme of &quot;a&quot; or &quot;b&quot; white sugar, eligible for a periodic refund, will close on May 19, the notice in the Official Journal of May 3 states.</p>
</text>
